#: ../../source/janim/timeline/pause_points.rst:2
msgid "pause_points"
msgstr "pause_points"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin:1 of
msgid "向 :class:`~.Timeline` 提供标记暂停点的功能"
msgstr "Provides the ability to mark pause points for :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.subtitles.SubtitlesMixin:5 of
msgid "该类中的方法都可以直接在 :class:`~.Timeline` 中使用"
msgstr "All methods in this class can be used directly in :class:`~.Timeline`"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:1 of
msgid "标记在预览界面中，执行到当前时间点时会暂停"
msgstr "Mark that in the preview interface, execution will pause when reaching the current time point"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:5 of
msgid "在 GUI 界面中，可以使用 ``Ctrl+左方向键`` 快速移动到前一个暂停点，``Ctrl+右方向键`` 快速移动到后一个"
msgstr ""
"In the GUI interface, you can use ``Ctrl+Left Arrow`` to quickly move to the previous pause point, and ``Ctrl+Right "
"Arrow`` to quickly move to the next one"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:7 of
msgid "如果没按着 ``Ctrl`` 键，则会变为在前后的动画区间之间移动"
msgstr "If the ``Ctrl`` key is not held, it will instead move between the previous and following animation ranges"

#: ../../source/janim/timeline/pause_points.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:9 of
msgid "表示偏移多少秒，例如 ``offset=2`` 则是当前时刻的 2s 后"
msgstr "Represents how many seconds to offset, e.g., ``offset=2`` means 2 seconds after the current position"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:11 of
msgid ""
"控制是在前一帧暂停还是在当前帧暂停  默认为 ``True``，因为一般情况下我们暂停时想要显示先前画面中的最后一帧，而非随后画面 "
"（这是由 JAnim 动画区间左闭右开导致的）"
msgstr ""
"Controls whether to pause at the previous frame or the current frame. Defaults to ``True``, because in most cases when "
"pausing, we want to display the last frame of the previous scene rather than the following frame (this is caused by JAnim "
"animation intervals being left-closed and right-open)"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:11 of
msgid "控制是在前一帧暂停还是在当前帧暂停"
msgstr "Controls whether to pause at the previous frame or the current frame"

#: janim.timeline.pause_points.PausePointsMixin.pause_point:13 of
msgid ""
"默认为 ``True``，因为一般情况下我们暂停时想要显示先前画面中的最后一帧，而非随后画面 （这是由 JAnim 动画区间左闭右开导致"
"的）"
msgstr ""
"Defaults to ``True``, because in most cases when pausing, we want to display the last frame of the previous scene rather "
"than the following frame (this is caused by JAnim animation intervals being left-closed and right-open)"
